"note": "UR wave 2 round C flipbooks (r943 b, r944 a, r945 a, r946 a, r947 b, r942 a row 2 dust). Keys <gid>.<flip>.<n> (n = frame order, 1-based); pv = pivot: huatuo steam flipbooks use the shared ground-line centre of the row union box (pot stays put); every travelling/ground flipbook uses each frame's OWN bottom-centre (painted cell positions wander +-150 px and would flicker); pv_union = the row-union ground-line centre for all (frames keep the painted x/y wander; pv_own = the frame's own bottom-centre if the code prefers to re-centre) (bottom-centre of the row union box), css_per_px = css size of one atlas px, straight alpha. seq.<gid>.<flip> = frame keys in order, ms per frame (83 = 12 fps; 10-12 fps fine), loop or one-shot + fade_ms. Ox run r948 b: huangyueying.ox.1-4 + huangyueying.ox_wheel.1 (see meta.ox). Remaps at cut: r945 pot glow to cream F3E3B0 / gold D9B25A, r946 wisp fringe to navy; residual edge fringe to the neighbouring outline colour. | r950 grain fountain (huangyueying.grain.1-5 + grain_drop.1-8) appended below, see seq.huangyueying.grain.",
