"note": "grain fountain, r950 a (Decision 536): F1 kick, F2 burst, F3 column, F4 crown, F5 shower. ONE scale for all 5: css_per_px 0.5669 x the atlas px scale already applied = column sack-base-to-top 660 src px = 237.6 css = 3.4 squad heights (sh = 70 css); the pieces css [w,h] are already at that size. Cap: keep the top >= 8 css inside the field rect, shrink the shared scale to fit, never below 2.8 sh (x0.82), never clip. Kick is already x0.89 so its sack matches (124 src px). pv = sack bottom-centre, same ground line in all 5 (draw at the ground point of the middle front squad). grain_drop.1-4 = single grains, 5-8 = short wheat ears, pv = centre: drop from the crown top onto each LIVING front squad, >= 80 ms apart in travel order, none on an empty tile. F5/F1 pink spill remapped to gold at cut."
